<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Happy Birthday ❤️</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 50px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 22px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        button {
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: #ff4d6d;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background: #ff1e4d;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Happy Birthday 💐</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <p>
            Today is not just a day, it’s a celebration of **you** 💖  
            Your smile, kindness, and strength make the world brighter.  
            I’m so grateful to have you in my life.
        </p>

        <br>

        <button onclick="showMessage()">Click for a Surprise 🎁</button>

        <p id="surprise" style="display:none; margin-top:20px;">
            You are special, loved, and truly one of a kind ❤️  
            May all your dreams come true ✨
        </p>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("surprise").style.display = "block";
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
